meta {
  name: one LLM exchange
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/llm-wire/exchange/{{exchangeId}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  One exchange's two recorded lines, parsed: {request, response}, with response null while the exchange is open. The scan stops as soon as both lines are found. 404 for a foreign caller, a malformed id or xid, a missing sidecar or an unknown exchange.
  
  Fence: host+origin — Loopback fence plus Origin check: an Origin header, if present, must be loopback. REST clients send no Origin header, which counts as safe — requests pass. A manually added foreign Origin answers a blank 404.
  
  Writes state: no
}
